        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Seoul Train, Making North America\n- Companies: Incite Productions\n- Topics: North Korean defectors, North Korean refugees, China\n\nFacts:\n- Seoul Train is a 2004 documentary film about the dangerous journeys of North Korean defectors fleeing through or to China.\n- North Korean defectors in Seoul Train face forced repatriation, torture, and possible execution if they are caught.\n- Making North America is a 2015 American documentary film that premiered nationwide on November 4, 2015.\n- Incite Productions produced Seoul Train, a critically acclaimed PBS documentary on North Korean refugees.",
